            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Choose your Apple device frames</h2>
<ul>
<li>Download only the device packs you want: iPhone 17 and Air, iPhone Duo, iPad Pro, MacBook Pro, or Apple Watch Ultra.</li>
<li>See each pack’s download size, the selected total, and which packs are already installed.</li>
<li>Add more packs later without downloading your existing packs again.</li>
<li>Import just the selected Apple DMGs while preserving existing frames, projects, and styles.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
