            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Apple device frames</h2>
<ul>
<li>Get all 65 Apple device frames directly from Apple using Get Apple Frames in the frame sidebar.</li>
<li>Install iPhone, iPad, MacBook Pro, and Apple Watch artwork with progress, cancellation, and integrity checks.</li>
<li>Import the five Apple DMGs from disk if you already downloaded them.</li>
<li>Keep the existing plain frames, saved projects, styles, and personal frame library.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
